1791751294333476	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1i3	{"body":"Code done, unit-tested (Core/Claims.cs), not live-tested (Bob in Quad's game). World/Claims.cs: OreClaim stake (Misc, no workbench) surveys every 15 s when loaded via ZNetScene.m_instances (crypt interior y>3000), deposit yield from drop tables x alive hit areas x resourcerate; camp = bed+chest+warm fire within 15 m; global key jarldom_claim_<id>; reconcile Taken by destroying worked-out deposits; Miner Work.Next -> Claims.Next -> ClaimTrip (away mine:<id>:<secs>:<guard>; idle guard escorts when danger >=5%); Colony.Rise -> Claims.Home (ore to bag/stores, wound/death loses pickaxe). Work tab 'Ore claims'. Test: jarldom claims [survey|send <name>]. Verify live: tin/copper stake, camp detection, a trip and return, depletion on revisit, crypt iron."}	blake3:xF60Hi8JWIVpuJtiK61dFHfPZkzh-zo0YqH-6-hfVpw
1791752463110596	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3ef	{"description":"ZoneSystem.GlobalKeyAdd increments m_playerStats[*].m_knownWorldKeys[keyText] for the full 'key value' text. Jarldom writes changing values (cargo keys with random ids per cart trip, claims on reserve changes, colony announce, owed coins), so each distinct value adds a profile entry that's saved in the .fch forever. Fix idea: keep changing data on a still ZDO (as the saga/board are) and use global keys only for stable pointers; or prune jarldom_* entries from m_knownWorldKeys on save.","kind":"bug","labels":["jarldom"],"parent":"bn-2zi","title":"Global key churn bloats player profiles: every SetGlobalKey value is counted in PlayerProfile m_knownWorldKeys"}	blake3:HvQpJOQf4VS5XBDmEj9kpyIMYQm5T-wVLDMNEwha6yU
1791757870621050	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1m6	{"body":"Live: 26 of 27 torches relit by haulers/idle helpers from 40 resin in the stores; one torch at 361,1174 blocked (unreachable). Dusk lamplighter not exercised (all fires fuelled at dusk). Fire deaths from fuelling found and fixed (no burning at colony hearths)."}	blake3:0E7ap1waas7ZhV2363H49J4bbh3Gqo8ODHFVWyHw4cY
1791757870634079	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-1m6	{"state":"done"}	blake3:BKpnPGGA2NTg9n_NZrrKdeNtL94T5WQ3KrEGYwMKuYs
1791757885211737	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-18q	{"body":"Live: gathered 13/14 into the great hall (chores now dropped at once), matters read out, ruling panel at the foot of the screen after 3 s; Bob ruled on Tofa (let it be), guards' wages (raise, now real), beds (promise), and a test matter told by Rognvald: 'we drank to it. that totally worked'."}	blake3:Ffr-zIu_NsIc10Nm0yyFMv-97G4hpEY_2dfzfH1IITU
1791757885234552	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-18q	{"state":"done"}	blake3:dnkFoCn9pt2VpgF_ic8EmTB27ht7WsjRrCwt8lKBau8
1791757885249589	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1i3	{"body":"Live: tin (bare, 10), untouched copper (~390), copper camp of 2 beds (two miners at once), silver vein (~250, tier 2), sunken crypt iron (~234 from a stake at its door); trips home with ore, one wounded, Freydis escorting the crypt; worked deposits removed on next survey; loads made realistic by weight on Bob's word."}	blake3:vapD295wzyvpai-LJLiBG9jaZbXfXTVU0Ayr3gc4Sr8
