1791775111577024	claude-buildshapes	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1tx	{"description":"Bob (2026-10-11, screenshot of a gable end): the preview looks like the real structure but strange overlapping planes cause z-fighting; been there since the beginning. Likely cause: HallMeshes (HallRuntime.cs ~line 425) draws every enabled MeshFilter under an active parent, so a piece's LODGroup high AND low meshes, and its new/worn/broken WearNTear variants, all render at once (e.g. hearth has new/high, new/low, worn/*, broken/*). Fix: draw only LOD0 of each LODGroup and only the 'new' wear state (or whatever WearNTear.m_new points to). For later, not now.","kind":"bug","labels":["buildshapes"],"parent":"bn-8qm","title":"Hallwright preview: overlapping planes z-fight on the ghost previews"}	blake3:nCNpv3DhPNnxNnj-An-iyLC7tRM1hgP8MbDqNYXgVrI
