1791834820318662	valheim-mods-e5q5hz	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1zq	{"description":"Bob 2026-10-12: coming back to the colony, the while-you-were-gone message is sometimes so long it gets cut off. Fix: cap and summarise it on screen (counts per kind, top few lines) and put the full list somewhere readable (colony window/saga), not one huge centre message.","kind":"bug","labels":["jarldom"],"parent":"bn-2zi","title":"Jarldom: the 'while you were gone' message on returning is cut off when it's long"}	blake3:z1VdO3SQG4I2mEV6MXQYIM3c1zzuaI8MMmg0VdmIGjQ
