1791857863907669	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1wnc	{"description":"# Context & Background\nSpec 2.3 #25. With Runecarver it renders in runes with an English hover (#25b).\n# Implementation Approach\nNew piece JarldomMemorialWall (carved wall, buildable in the hall). Data: list of ascended (and \"rests with Hel\" #26) entries from the record/saga (name, byname, deed, date). UI: hover/E opens a paged text panel (rows and pages); world-space text on the wall optional. Pure paging logic in Core + tests.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Shows all ascended souls with deed and date; pages work with 30+ entries.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nRemembrance; used by #26 and J4 Winter Nights.\n","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","next-saga","j3","p2"],"parent":"bn-3k3","size":"m","title":"J3 #25a: Memorial wall piece for the great hall - ascended souls (name, byname, worthy deed, date) in rows and pages"}	blake3:ouWtaTvS-a-layrIy8K6WsMiSRmb3rbrr31RpOatoEs
