1791857864028501	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1idp	{"description":"# Context & Background\nSpec 2.3 #25 + 3.10 (Runecarver C3 Jarldom API).\n# Implementation Approach\nVia ApiRef, if Runecarver.Api present: render the wall's entries as Younger Futhark carving with English hover; otherwise plain text. Blocked on the Runecarver Jarldom API milestone (other goal).\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] With Runecarver: runes + English hover; without: plain, no errors.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nTies Runecarver into the colony.\n","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","next-saga","j3","p2","integration","runecarver"],"parent":"bn-3k3","size":"s","title":"J3 #25b: Memorial wall in runes via Runecarver.Api (English on hover); plain text without Runecarver"}	blake3:R0QvwbWfX-TS7RywBC-mXN6fVdRsRlFXgN4Wcm4Q19I
