1791858014057329	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-epg	{"body":"Moved from J5 to J3 (2026-10-12, plan wiring): J3 #24 the Dimming's way back is 'a Dimmed soul asks for a deed (one of their requests, #32)' and J3's acceptance test needs it, while the build order puts J3 before J5. So the #32 request core/completion/panel lands in J3; J5 keeps BountyBoard (#33) and the other roaming features, which build on it."}	blake3:4jf_tFtRGRqTLrrMOsmzzh-imSKILf3mjUi5Tjc7m24
