1791858026150852	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-355a	{"description":"# Context & Background\nHorses R3 (spec 3.4) harnesses a horse to \"a cart (PassengerCart through its API, or the game's cart)\". mods/PassengerCart has no Api.cs yet (only Omens and Shieldwall publish one). Decision bn-1jv (carts stay Jarldom behaviour, integrate via APIs) applies.\n# Goals\nA tiny PassengerCart.Api (int Version + e.g. IsPassengerCart(GameObject), AttachPuller(cart, Transform puller), Detach(cart)) that Horses binds by reflection, so the cart's Vagon attach logic is reused rather than re-implemented.\n# Implementation Approach\nRead mods/PassengerCart for how the vanilla Vagon attach point is used (see passengercart-design memory: public-field Instantiate gotcha). Follow the Api convention from bn-1xw. Release PassengerCart with the new Api.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] PassengerCart.Api published with Version; PassengerCart behaviour unchanged without Horses.\n- [ ] Horses' cart harness (bn-27re) can attach a horse to the passenger cart through it.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nLets horses pull Bob's passenger cart without a hard dependency.","kind":"task","labels":["horses","passengercart","r3","next-saga","standalone","integration"],"parent":"bn-1k8","size":"s","title":"PassengerCart.Api: expose a harness hook so Horses can pull the 4-seat cart","urgency":"punt"}	blake3:hN-7g8eluPNusWBDnNhQjuL4PznLQ-x0OiRTZ2gMMvI
1791858026179597	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-355a	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-1xw"}	blake3:0Q4HYTEg9HpEyIwuFLVXAhFCDn5jMIqBbnol6JfUMrE
1791858026202667	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-27re	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-355a"}	blake3:Jb5-k42CdtCZcpC5AS1mmCd-QhLqGMo2yA81RCPgdGY
1791858026223458	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-355a	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-1jv"}	blake3:c81XUZXsWp0QlwIYuEhTvHObHLFOLo9xRBdVGlfuofc
1791858026241113	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-26ce	{"body":"Soft link: Sigrblot's '+10% trade runs and expeditions' applies to trade runs now; the expedition part hooks into J6 #53 (bn-2yt) once it exists (J6 comes after J4, so not wired as a blocker)."}	blake3:khNuks63-jj0DKEByIh-3cFeugPlX5su5YzPv-ngBCk
1791858026257349	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2r4x	{"body":"Soft link: 'joining an expedition' counts as a way back once J6 #53 expeditions exist (bn-2yt); until then the raid, gothi rite and request paths cover it. Requests (#32) were moved into J3 for this bone."}	blake3:bKuppvSUk4L5kBzAMwuUeseqS3dyNdEA6cg16rDWiNo
1791858153210843	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-qs7	{"body":"Found (2026-10-12): Arena is Quad's mod, ~/repos/valheim-mods/mods/Arena (pulled to 98e8796), plugin com.quad.arena 0.4.3, namespace Arena. It has NO Api class and every useful member is internal: Contest (static, per fighter's client: Active/Fighting, Phase enum None..Victory, KindOf Road/Champion/Endless/Trial, private Outcome Win/CashOut/Yield/Died/TimeUp/LeftRing/..., TitleLine = what other players are told), Site (Known, Origin, Yaw, World(local) for stand positions), Ladder (Title(), Wins, Hall()). Net.cs broadcasts contest lines to other players. Everyone in the world must have Arena installed. Next step: bn-3on is blocked on an upstream Arena.Api PR (new bone)."}	blake3:LQzUjXsabRq-GCjVCQdwQNpzcO9D_V5li5uHlsv01D0
1791858153230391	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-qs7	{"state":"done"}	blake3:0xmmSbq6hl0NkqOdb6VjeOyIKhgDqTft0AttdWykNoA
1791858153347841	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1hcg	{"description":"# Context & Background\nJ8 #83 (spec 2.8): during your Arena run, up to 6 off-duty villagers stand in the stands and each may bet up to 10% of their hoard on you; wins/losses move coins and mood; champions get a byname. Arena is Quad's mod (~/repos/valheim-mods/mods/Arena, com.quad.arena 0.4.3) and has no public Api; Contest/Site/Ladder are internal statics (see bn-qs7 comment). Bob contributes PRs upstream (e.g. BuildOrders PR #3), so this is a PR, not an edit we ship.\n# Goals\nA tiny `Arena.Api` static class Jarldom can bind by reflection (bn-1xw convention), visible to EVERY client, not just the fighter's.\n# Implementation Approach\n- Contest state is per fighter's client; other peers learn of it through Arena's Net.cs broadcasts. Expose what the colony owner can see: `int Version`; `bool IsContestRunning(out string fighter, out string kind)`; `Vector3[] StandSpots(int max)` from Site.World over the stands layout (Layout.json); an event or poll `bool LastResult(out string fighter, out string kind, out bool won, out int purse, out long when)` fired on Victory/Died/CashOut etc.; `string Title(string player)` if Ladder titles are readable for others.\n- Keep it read-only; no Jarldom concepts in Arena.\n- Follow Quad's repo rules (its CLAUDE.md, changelog/manifest style); open the PR from a branch, don't push to his main.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] PR opened upstream with the Api, Version = 1, a changelog line, no behaviour change.\n- [ ] Bob/Quad merge it (or agree on a different shape); bn-3on updated to match.\n# How This Serves Project Goals\nUnblocks Arena x Jarldom without a hard dependency in either direction.","kind":"task","labels":["j8","jarldom","arena","next-saga","integration","upstream"],"parent":"bn-1gf","size":"s","title":"#83 Arena upstream PR: add Arena.Api (Version, contest running/fighter/kind, stand spots, contest-ended outcome) to Quad's mod"}	blake3:WZrmmZDM-gkPCzuSHoIIqPSUBcLhCs_W54q5aGrdUQ8
1791858153377962	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-1hcg	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-1xw"}	blake3:2aca97ygodZ3zeKZn0Z2OddTIAP51g1fUF3gjfUz7U0
1791858153400007	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.link	bn-3on	{"link_type":"blocks","target":"bn-1hcg"}	blake3:AtmAZUFwwUWPIHTDlX1bePJVp8X2BGdpskujhO8nVkc
1791858153418301	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3on	{"body":"Arena is Quad's mod (see bn-qs7); it has no Api, so this waits on the upstream PR bn-1hcg. Arena's contest state lives on the fighter's client; bind to the Api, not to internals."}	blake3:ywSr2sHOUs1OAyI_3GXA5lWcLAWkEXGaf5cxxs905vg
1791858718718917	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1hcg	{"body":"PR opened 2026-10-12: https://github.com/HardHeadHackerHead/valheim-mods/pull/13 (branch bob/arena-api, commit 5a21d0c, Arena 0.4.4 not released, dist untouched). Api v1: IsContestRunning(out fighter, out kind), ArenaAt(out centre), StandSpots(max), ResultCount + LastResult(out fighter, kind, outcome, won, crowned, coins, when). Docs: docs/arena-api.md in Quad's repo. Not yet tried in game (needs two players). Waiting on Quad to merge."}	blake3:mB-vwuKW_037aNgjMXOaG5eBZcX0ENZfLiNOr-ZLFx0
1791858718735114	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1xw	{"body":"From the Arena PR (docs/arena-api.md) and Quad's Cigars API precedent: find a mod's Api through its LIVE plugin, Chainloader.PluginInfos[guid].Instance.GetType().Assembly.GetType(\"<Mod>.Api\"), not by scanning every assembly for the type name: after an F6 reload the old assembly is still loaded and a name scan can bind the stale copy. Re-resolve when the plugin instance changes."}	blake3:kVetnAIanodsqoxDxPj537VFNBGkMdMJ6IpM557VIlo
1791858718752652	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3on	{"body":"Arena.Api v1 shape is in PR #13 (see bn-1hcg): poll ResultCount, read LastResult; StandSpots gives seats (stand beside them, the crowd sits on them). Other players' fights only show if their Arena is 0.4.4+."}	blake3:5tIXb5oMMkFvhj56t4o4HYHUbT4S_l4KOpFP1klgb7k
