1792039380923148	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1us4	{"description":"Between two checks her bag went from AxeBronze/ArmorTunic7/HelmetTrollLeather/ArmorTrollLeatherLegs/ArrowSilver/Amber/Tankard to nothing (then she refitted from the stores: dress, flint knife). Items not in any chest, bag, ground drop or tomb. Coincided with deploying KeepAwake (0.1.136). A plain forced reload diff showed no change. Deaths=1 lifetime. Added log 'X's bag loaded from the soul/body: was [...], now [...]' in Body.LoadOnce. Watch: periodic bag snapshots diff.","kind":"bug","labels":["jarldom"],"title":"Jarldom: Bergthora lost her whole bag (bronze axe, troll hood+legs, tunic) ~00:24-00:27 2026-10-15, no death, no tomb","urgency":"urgent"}	blake3:SfiNRHTswu1O6Mu4WTmJnc2ackGcH6Y0ccJomo-ouNc
