1792046497575846	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-gn7s	{"description":"Found 2026-10-15 overnight. Haulers now carry festival goods to hall chests (0.1.142) but the only hall chest can't be walked up to. Bob: put a chest in the hall where villagers can stand next to it. Yule is day ~234.","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","needs-player"],"title":"Jarldom: the great hall's only chest (292,1122, in the Odin shrine nook) is out of the haulers' reach, so Yule can't be readied (60 food, 20 mead)"}	blake3:XpXM5jMhBB7DD1c0AUaCncAzW3AWuS9O1cQs_fC-lJo
1792058576449147	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3c6c	{"description":"Reforest.cs:111 calls c.ClosestPoint(spot) on every collider from the overlap, including non-convex MeshColliders of pieces. Unity logs 'Physics.ClosestPoint can only be used with a BoxCollider, SphereCollider, CapsuleCollider and a convex MeshCollider.' 811 times in one overnight session (LogOutput.log, 2026-10-15). Fix: for MeshCollider with !convex (or TerrainCollider) use ClosestPointOnBounds, as Jarldom's Work.Closest does. Source attribution is by elimination (WrongUniverse calls only on hits, Jarldom guards it); confirm before fixing.","kind":"bug","labels":["gary"],"title":"Gary: Reforest calls Collider.ClosestPoint on concave MeshColliders (log spam)"}	blake3:hqYRr0vSUnXuruj6LDf3a434lkoPOJ14Ou2hWZxUvxg
1792093584424595	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3tne	{"description":"Jarldom 0.1.145 and BuildKit 0.2.3 fixed this with a Leftovers.cs handover (see either file): the old copy hands its made materials/meshes/icons/prefabs to the next via AppDomain data; the new copy swaps its own onto what's standing and destroys the rest. These mods also make HideAndDontSave materials/meshes/textures and likely leak a set per hot reload. Measure first (count assets before/after one reload), then apply the pattern where it grows. Dev-only cost: players never hot reload.","kind":"bug","labels":["perf"],"title":"Hot reloads leak old copies' assets in Hallwright, Demolisher, BuildShapes, Factorheim"}	blake3:7yzwo7cdlPs7KVMoZDVjeVUHEvmRN5ZG8dby07q2gzM
