1792101244858378	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-tnn3	{"field":"description","value":"# Context & Background\nSpec: a stall barn piece set. Checked against the game 2026-10-15: stall dividers and gates are the game's wood_fence and wood_fence_gate (and stave_gate), so not made.\n\n# Goals\nOnly what the game lacks: a hay rack/manger and a water trough (functional for Byre animals), and a barn floor that animals stay in."}	blake3:36jJuK7TTqt6bHb6SqnJv_T-H8YeulxPSyNPpk9L0PA
1792101244878681	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-3sn6	{"field":"description","value":"# Context & Background\nSpec: stave church temple style. BuildKit's own stave/shingle/dragon pieces were cut in 0.3.0 (the game has them).\n\n# Goals\nA Hallwright style that builds a temple from the game's own pieces: the Deep North stave set (stave_wall_2x2, stave_pole, stave_beam, stave_deco_*, stave_gate), darkwood roofs (shingled), and wood_dragon1 / darkwood_raven ridge-end carvings."}	blake3:XuQpB95su-_uM_HniPCSpL-NBU5zzOdBJBGt3-Y2xtY
1792101244902129	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-i4ld	{"field":"title","value":"Jarldom: kit pieces count in room grades (Colony/Classes.cs): turf roof, smoke vents, wattle"}	blake3:t19d0XkfxG0UtnIi0tMmSeihfW91CjJoW_nAsom8e7Y
1792101244906718	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-i4ld	{"field":"description","value":"# Context & Background\nSpec: Jarldom recognises BuildKit pieces for room grades. Colony/Classes.cs decides what a piece is for the whole mod. Wall benches were dropped (Bob builds sleeping bays from stock beds) and the carved portal was cut in BuildKit 0.3.0.\n\n# Goals\nClasses recognises turf roofs (roof, +warmth), smoke holes/ridge vents (a vented hearth), wattle and daub (walls), so traditionally built longhouses grade higher."}	blake3:qFGWjYkLgjsW9on8u7jXe3a8ZqsMgu3WO0mUPfXhboM
1792101244922619	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-3ik	{"field":"description","value":"# Context & Background\nViking building kit: only pieces the game lacks (check BepInEx/blueprints/_pieces.json first; 0.3.0 cut shingle roofs, dragon ridge ends and stave pieces as duplicates; wall benches dropped; shutters/frames/lintels closed as duplicates).\nShipped: turf roofs (all shapes, +1 comfort), smoke-hole roofs, ridge smoke vents, wattle fence, wattle and daub wall.\nOpen: market stall and granary on stilts (not in the game; Bob to decide if they earn a place), Hallwright styles (turf longhouse; stave temple from the game's own stave set), Jarldom room grades.\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each piece absent from the game, snaps and carries load correctly; Hallwright styles use them."}	blake3:mePgJ7Tc9Icqck4pIRi5u_98jcKr5rmrb4_6NwaCqMA
