1792108236214113	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1w4y	{"description":"Bob 2026-10-15: 'we need a camping mod with lean-to shelters, bed rolls, etc.' Checked the game's pieces first: it has beds (bed, piece_bed02, ashwood_bed) but no bedroll, tent or lean-to. Plan: standalone mod (useful to every player, like BuildKit); bedroll = a spawn point/sleep spot that packs into an item, lean-to = small roofed shelter counting as cover. Jarldom camps (World/Expedition.cs CampTask) put up a lean-to and bedrolls when the mod is installed, else today's fire/chest/workbench. Check _pieces.json again before adding any piece.","kind":"task","labels":["camping","jarldom","standalone"],"title":"Camping mod (standalone): lean-to shelters, bedrolls, camp pieces for the wilds; Jarldom expeditions use them when installed"}	blake3:el4jF49ZKW3It7tIwDig6peCB4LM3kTgFmpbD5syylk
