1792298285311144	claude-bathhouse	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-2303	{"description":"Wool was the Norse cloth. Lox wool puts it late (Plains); sheep in Byre puts it early but makes wool depend on Byre (soft: Homespun alone would use lox). Nettle fibre (real history) gives early linen-like cloth but is a new plant. Bob to pick.","kind":"task","labels":["homespun","next-saga","standalone","h1","decision","byre"],"parent":"bn-3kf","title":"Decide: Homespun fibres - wool from lox (Plains) or from Byre's sheep (Meadows/Black Forest), and whether to add nettle as an early cloth plant"}	blake3:qteRFVoAHnfL2N__NmMKFaXc8wP-PtEflgUV6bN4GHY
