1792300890791900	claude-homespun	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3qdg	{"body":"Done (maw workspace homespun, commit 747af37, not merged): Core/Chain.cs is the whole chain as data (conversions, makes, garments, Hildir's 27) with Raw() back to what's gathered; tests/Homespun.Tests passes 125 checks (chain closes, yields, pool time, spindle vs wheel, Raw with and without Byre, golden list). Nothing in it needs the game; could be closed."}	blake3:0XhJUtKY6h_QCtilo_6V6A6Q8OBfq2f28O1Fu-5BYIU
1792300890813444	claude-homespun	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-zdk8	{"body":"Done offline (maw workspace homespun, commit 747af37, not merged): retting pool (flax->retted 45s, holds 40) and flax brake (retted->line flax, lox pelt->4 wool, 10s, holds 20) as Smelter clones of the spinning wheel, baked models with hackle and drying rack. One pace per smelter, so both brake inputs take 10s. Untested: switches and their reach, output points, the extra-yield patch on QueueProcessed, colliders vs model, MP owner (an owner without the mod refuses and the item is lost - game behaviour)."}	blake3:plEI04syynwQ9WjN2i_4WlLMMl-_msRbGTPhm59Q3HA
1792300890832785	claude-homespun	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-7r9x	{"body":"Done offline (maw workspace homespun, commit 747af37, not merged): drop spindle item (workbench: 2 wood, 1 stone), spins line flax then wool then fleece from the bag while held, local only, no attack. The wheel also takes line flax (2 thread) and wool/fleece. Untested: the hand pose (equipoffset -90 about x, as Godforged's hammer: may need tuning), timing feel, messages."}	blake3:JDac_HT1pYRiTiUJ_miEvAgW7QxdHVzSdpN08Idm8WY
1792300890850696	claude-homespun	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3vj1	{"body":"Done offline (maw workspace homespun, commit 747af37, not merged): warp-weighted loom as a CraftingStation (not a ZDO queue: a smelter can't take many-in-one-out): linen bolt 8 thread, wool bolt 8 yarn, 2 bands 2 thread + 2 yarn. Baked model leaned 12 degrees with ring weights, shed and heddle rods. Untested: StationUseArea trigger kept from the workbench clone, recipe list, the look in game light."}	blake3:YZ68scgIJETMP3RijTuS9SSAS0aVdCBnXLY4zohUId8
1792300890870757	claude-homespun	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2pd8	{"body":"Done offline (maw workspace homespun, commit 747af37, not merged): sewing table CraftingStation; undertunic, tunic, dress, trousers, hooded cloak are the game's ArmorTunic10/ArmorDress10/ArmorRagsLegs/CapeLinen retinted (no new clothing mesh in H1), armour 1-3, quality 2; Hildir's clothes at the table from bolts (+berries, Jarldom's colours). Untested: the tint when worn (m_armorMaterial body textures can't be tinted), recipe balance."}	blake3:7I1L6NHUyt2xKw-iS5IbRtkoU6vIn7JKIZ_UkXFviOQ
