1792301125616684	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-5xhx	{"body":"Built offline (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): mods/Byre (cx.bob.byre 0.1.0, reload level menu + RESTART_REQUIRED.txt), Core/, ServerSettings/Costs/Content/ContainerAccess/Icon/Registry templates, DESCRIPTION, CHANGELOG (0.1.0 unreleased), README with playtest checklist, cover.jpg, tests/Byre.Tests (41 checks pass, golden prefabs.txt with 11 names). Builds clean with -p:DeployToGame=false. Byre.Api: Version 1, IsLivestock, IsWool, Products, Kinds, Grown/Young, IsTame, IsReady. UNTESTED: load in game, mise publish (dist untouched), byre help through the mailbox, F6 (it's restart-level: no hot reload)."}	blake3:2MT6GVc27ex58RtuXEU1txB8vOlMbnCk28KKLo9NsBA
1792301125645055	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2pv7	{"body":"Done offline (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): Core/Species.cs (sheep, goat table: biome, herd, tilt, flee range, taming/fed/grow secs, foods, product/tool, period, yields) and Core/Husbandry.cs (Ready/Remaining/Period with hungry x2, Yield fed 2-3 / hungry 1, CanHarvest, Flees, SeeksTrough, Hours). Times are ZNet game seconds so sleep skips count; a clock set back counts as ready. 41 checks in tests/Byre.Tests pass. Breeding cap is Procreation.m_maxCreatures = Species.MaxNear (6)."}	blake3:OgpzffuE3--lABqzEZEl28QGhHOXLKtUihVsESieXuQ
1792301125664437	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3nt1	{"body":"Models made (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): both on the BOAR skeleton (not deer: Tameable needs MonsterAI, deer is AnimalAI and far taller). Blender scripts in mods/Byre/Models (animals.py, props.py, byrelib.py, export_rig.py; boar-rig.json is extracted offline from bundle c4210710 and NOT committed). Sheep 1500 tris + fleece 900 (separate skinned mesh, toggled by readiness from the ZDO long), goat 1812 incl horns rigid on Head, 256 px atlases, flat shaded, AO baked. Previews: ~/.cache/byre-rig/out/sheep_sheet.png, goat_sheet.png (rest/walk/graze/shorn/side/front). UNTESTED in game: real boar animations on our skin (neck/leg stretching), bounds/culling, star scale, ragdoll. Needs Bob's look approval."}	blake3:GEYM_X3QI84SrdeRGlDvq1xg0-2lRKL4a_vonH4AJyU
1792301125684097	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1z77	{"body":"Built offline (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): ByreSheep/ByreGoat (Boar clones), ByreLamb/ByreKid (Boar_piggy clones, Growup 3000 s), ByreSheep_ragdoll/ByreGoat_ragdoll (boar_ragdoll). No attack items, AnimalsVeg, flee when hurt, wild ones flee players (8/10 m, half crouching) in a MonsterAI.UpdateAI postfix; deer hit/death/idle sounds; goat m_jumpInterval 9 (slopes: every non-player AI already ignores slide angle). Drops meat + scraps (+1 wool from a woolly sheep). Spawns: own SpawnSystemList added in SpawnSystem.Awake, Meadows sheep tilt 0-25 outside forest, Mountain goats tilt 15-60, group 2-4, chance 25, interval 600, max 3, day only; off while the server lacks the mod; synced settings. UNTESTED: everything live, especially spawn rates and whether alerted-flee lets taming progress."}	blake3:9OypO1FevwLnVpXAJahPjfjYPxTeKVZnRy4Jc2-bgAc
1792301125703873	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-7p74	{"body":"Built offline (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): ByreShears (forge, Copper:3), ByreMilkPail (workbench, Wood:6), ByreWool (material), ByreGoatMilk (food 12/30/regen 2, 1200 s), own models and drawn icons, value 0. E (Tameable.Interact prefix) or use-item with the tool in the bag on a grown tame animal -> owner RPC Byre_Harvest rechecks, sets ZDO long byre_last, drops the yield at its feet. Hover shows ready/needs tool or 'grows back: N h'. Wild ones and young are never harvested. UNTESTED live, incl multiplayer race."}	blake3:Y3DsgUMXu_TJZjtOemDVZi1rkLoHAekik28lc5jpJ0s
1792301125721685	claude-byre	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-24mi	{"body":"Built offline (maw workspace byre, commit 9ae65eb, not merged, not deployed): ByreTrough (piece_chest_wood clone, 4x1, dh_notstorage, workbench Wood:10, Misc tab). Prefix on MonsterAI.UpdateConsumeItem: a hungry tame animal of any kind within 12 m of a trough holding its food walks over, ContainerAccess.TakeOver, removes one, runs m_onConsumedItem + consume effect/trigger. Every 10 s per animal. UNTESTED live."}	blake3:siR7tVyTJImni3COC1xy_RKft7lAgra0cD4IF3Qeglo
