1792363953729955	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1z77	{"body":"Live 2026-10-18: wild sheep herd (2) spawned naturally in the Meadows at ~(170,1005). Breeding: a fed tame goat pair in a fence pen had 2 kids within ~4 min. Taming: was blocked (boar AI kept wild ones alerted by villagers far off; alerted never tames) - fixed in 0.1.2 (alerted only by a player within 2x flee range or being hurt); after the fix a baited wild sheep went 1200 -> 1146 s calm and fed; full tame not watched (taming pauses when the zone isn't simulated, as vanilla). Jarldom hunter Thorir killed 3 wild test sheep near the colony. LEFT (needs-player): goat herds in the Mountains, goats on slopes, a full tame."}	blake3:hn22YxTLrUS6INn-OYuRWb7k9L1q6BVcE0eNrOysct0
