1792363953931534	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-fc2r	{"description":"Seen 2026-10-18: Thorir Coin-wanting (hunter) killed three wild ByreSheep near the colony, one mid-taming (fed, taming time ticking). Byre's animals are AnimalsVeg like boars, so hunters treat them as game. Decide (Bob): leave wild livestock alone entirely (Byre.Api.IsLivestock), spare only ones being tamed (fed / tame time below full), or keep hunting them as mutton.","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","byre","decision"],"title":"Jarldom hunters kill Byre's wild sheep and goats, even one a player is taming"}	blake3:c-9Sopno3D0-KEWy22oun8wUFvVG3DxcnpgRY2i0B4A
1792364438139631	valheim-mods-a2j4lt	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-9ydr	{"description":"Server-side Away.cs: when a player has been offline for 10 s, their Gary is parked at (-90000,0,-90000) and returns to the saved spot when they reconnect. Check: (1) a second player logs out and their Gary disappears for everyone after about 10 s; (2) they log back in and Gary reappears where he was, then follows; (3) logging out while he waits at home brings him back at home; (4) logging out on a boat brings him back near the deck, and he reboards or swims ashore; (5) dying and respawning does not send him away; (6) restarting the dedicated server parks everyone's Gary until they join.","kind":"task","labels":["gary","needs-multiplayer"],"title":"Gary 0.5.8: playtest leave-on-logout in multiplayer"}	blake3:SAJK-Y7G1L2m3tnIgXDT6oFO4WZpoke0piBYGwR7gos
