1792365668082982	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1z77	{"body":"Live 2026-10-18 (cont.): full tame watched: two wild Meadows sheep baited (byre bait) with Bob parked ~50 m off, calm and fed throughout, both tame after ~20 min (taming time 1200 -> 0, re-baited once as the fed timer ran out). Mountains at (-150,1850): a wild herd of 3 goats spawned within a minute on a steep snowy ridge ~170 m up (picture shown to Bob). All criteria met."}	blake3:B1rvPVAgAWrOtTeKba0uO3cLeadhXX3qyeTUuRSg4Pk
