1792367966944498	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-31qi	{"body":"Done in Jarldom 0.1.205 (2026-10-18): textile stations (pool, brake, wheel) posted to the weaver and emptied by her (RPC_EmptyProcessed); feeding rules in Weaving.FeedTextile; weaver's scan plans garment <- bolt <- thread a step at a time (HomespunNext/Step); hand spinning from line flax / combed wool without a wheel; Homespun garments count as clothes; loom/table recipes are the weaver's (commissions too). Live: Alfhild (miner made weaver for the test) soaked, broke, spun 8 thread by hand, wove a linen bolt, sewed ArmorTunic9; Thorstein (in rags) put it on. NOT tested: wool chain (lox pelt / Byre fleece -> yarn -> wool bolt -> Homespun tunic/dress worn), a spinning wheel, multiplayer. ByreWool has no hand-spin recipe (only via a wheel)."}	blake3:Kgpc6Zug_7jipn5qYagJDcQn_qcPlE0h2nl1O434fkU
1792386649338712	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-31qi	{"body":"Done in Jarldom 0.1.206 (b100f74). Live-checked the wool chain: 6 lox pelts combed at the brake to wool, hand-spun to yarn (no wheel), then a spinning wheel in the smithy spun the rest plus line flax to thread; 2 wool bolts and a tablet-woven band at the loom, a Homespun_WoolTunic at the sewing table, worn by Thorstein (stripped for the test). Fixes found: brake fed flax before pelts; pelt carry ignored the keep-two; waiting line flax counted as thread so a wheel never spun it (no band ever); a roofless wheel was fed and blocked hand spinning; bathers counted as in rags. The linen chain was checked in 0.1.205."}	blake3:ggy7A78iA4whxT_XJPJvXnqRqQSYGju1TWzF2Kc2ndc
1792386649358900	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2qde	{"body":"Live-tested in Creative (linen chain 0.1.205, wool chain 0.1.206) and released Jarldom 0.1.205/0.1.206 and Homespun 0.1.2. Not tested: multiplayer."}	blake3:aqLtliBX_rTRf_KFXVYmjyGj0Ywvuthx8LfQ7sN-ZGM
1792386649377411	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3vj1	{"body":"Live-checked 2026-10-19: the colony's weaver wove linen bolts, wool bolts and bands at the loom (Jarldom drives the recipes); the loom's recipe list and use area work."}	blake3:Mzb6-xjh_9O1IIm60Mf4nm977siwjYGNPp4q_GTQjQk
