1792390966204578	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3tn9	{"body":"Tested 2026-10-19 on Bob's test character 'trash' in TrashPlanet (both backed up and restored byte-for-byte after; Bob's own character never loaded without Homespun). Homespun swapped for an empty stand-in with its GUID, reloaded at the menu. Results: (1) both installed: works (live chains in Creative). (2) Jarldom without Homespun: loads and runs, no exceptions, Compat sees Homespun off. (3) Homespun without Jarldom: no code dependency (Api found by reflection the other way). (4) remove Homespun: every Homespun item in the bag is dropped on load ('Failed to find item prefab', the game's Inventory.AddItem) and gone at the next save; placed Homespun pieces and dropped Homespun items in a loaded area are destroyed by the host ('Destroyed invalid prefab ZDO') and don't come back on reinstall; Homespun fibres queued in the game's wheel spin to nothing. All game behaviour for any content mod; documented in Homespun 0.1.3's description (0039e4e). Hildir's clothes made at the sewing table are vanilla items and stay. Dyed colour data: not built yet (H2)."}	blake3:IxKvsYhdNCy49Fj6QHhXB9C-w06fyFZfBZYJZvk0iE0
1792390966232233	claude	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-3tn9	{"state":"done"}	blake3:vyvnLMN1sxQnjzEFPnsWxriClfWhrhYxgITn_pI_HQY
1792435136762036	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2303	{"body":"Decided (Bob 2026-10-19): both wool sources stay - Byre's fleece (ByreWool) when Byre is installed, lox pelts combed at the brake otherwise or as well (as built in Homespun 0.1.2 / Jarldom 0.1.206). Nettle: yes, as the early cloth plant - filed as its own task."}	blake3:GoUh-k-epkk2Uk1va1LpN4t2wUEh3DbB-_8KHqpt1Nw
