1792435136912082	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-21gb	{"description":"Bob 2026-10-19 (bn-2303): nettle as an early cloth plant, since flax only grows in the Plains. Plan: a wild pickable nettle (own baked low-poly model, docs/model-baking.md) spawning in Meadows clearings and Black Forest edges; a sapling the cultivator plants (and Jarldom farmers can sow; it counts as fibre, not food, so it follows the flax rule from Jarldom 0.1.209: sown only while the weaver is short); Pool: nettle -> retted nettle, Brake: retted nettle -> line nettle, spindle/wheel: line nettle -> LinenThread at a lower yield than flax (coarser cloth, the same thread item so every garment recipe works). Check _pieces.json / the game for an existing nettle or thistle look before modelling. Jarldom: the weaver's chain feeds nettle like flax (Weaving.FeedOrder/FeedCap). Live test: pick, rett, break, spin, sew a garment; a villager does the same.","kind":"task","labels":["homespun","h1","assets","next-saga","standalone"],"parent":"bn-3kf","title":"Homespun: nettle, the early cloth plant (Meadows/Black Forest) - wild patches to pick, sown in fields, retted and broken like flax, spun to thread"}	blake3:kLyoaQqYkqPbtf0KWSkOacgtmRWAJLe6d_P-R3C0eqk
