1792452392760884	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3b0x	{"description":"Shipyard 0.1.0. In a world with build costs (Creative is free-build, so stages cost nothing there): place a slipway (hammer, Misc) with its bow end to the water, E to lay a keel, E to put in from the bag (partial stacks), watch each stage appear, E to launch. Then aboard: take the helm, row (forward stops at rowing pace), steer with A/D, back and stop; sit on the fore thwart; climb the ladder from the water. Check she floats level with two aboard and doesn't heel badly when turning. A færing is floating at about (378, 30, 1129) by the Creative test slipway at (365, 31.8, 1129.5) (test-tagged).","kind":"task","labels":["needs-player"],"title":"Shipyard: build a færing by hand and row her (needs Bob)"}	blake3:kFS7Q3jUqw0pyT8RV4_COyteO7WfeBL5q_kHrlGPlZ8
