1792460943108481	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-233f	{"description":"Shipped in Jarldom 0.1.220 with unit tests only. To check: hang 2+ Homespun tapestries in the great hall, then jarldom feast at dusk, expecting the 'feasthung' moodlet. Put wool bolts in a thief's bag, rule 'Fine them' at the Thing, and check the treasury gets the bolts. Put more than 6 bolts in a stockpile, then jarldom traderun <trader>.","kind":"task","labels":["jarldom","homespun","live-check"],"title":"Live-check Jarldom's tapestry feast and vadmal (fine paid in bolts, trader selling bolts)"}	blake3:DMVQudCB7sEO9PrVN_qtPcawfIo5GBh_tWwX4qrbdpw
1792462324123865	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3vg1	{"body":"Jarldom 0.1.221 (8a5fa93) with Shipyard 0.3.3 (d31f49a). Live: a knarr paid to her mast stage; the weaver sewed a wool sail (priority-4 order, ahead of the stations) and stored it; Hallbjorn, briefly a shipwright, fetched it and finished her. Then cleaned up: Hallbjorn back to Guard, slipway cleared, the stage's materials returned."}	blake3:lzdCKy7EDJ4_Jsb0H1ANM0NmGfebPciXsSPTPPBbQ7o
