1792466021827863	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3kf	{"body":"Acceptance evidence on current builds: (a) each milestone useful alone: Homespun runs with Jarldom removed (bn-383v step 4: garments worn, effects live, items kept), Jarldom/Shipyard/Wayfinder run with Homespun removed (step 2, no exceptions; offline audit + tests); (b) no item loss in any install order beyond the game's own rule for a removed content mod (its items go), documented in DESCRIPTION (bn-383v, bn-3tn9); (c) dyed colours seen by a second client (bn-3rzp); (d) Jarldom's weaver runs the chain incl. dyeing and the knarr's sail (bn-31qi, bn-3vg1)."}	blake3:Nk8NTDnUH1bmMAZ3Dcfvf8WmtVbCx59LqfnOYRiVLYk
