1792468436769589	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-5fu5	{"description":"Byre 0.3.0 (c008767) was live-tested with test commands only (README '0.3.0 live test'). Still to see in normal play: wild cattle and geese herds appearing in the Meadows (geese on low ground by water) and taming one with food; a pig led on foot through the Black Forest finding truffles at about one per 10 min (TruffleMinutes); eating a truffle and cow's milk; the cauldron's cooked egg from a goose egg (2 per egg); a calf and a gosling growing up; a goose's chase among buildings (indoors among benches it got stuck); whether the cow's 1.9x boar walk looks right.","kind":"task","labels":["byre","needs-player"],"size":"s","title":"Byre 0.3.0: play-check cattle, geese and pigs over time (wild spawns, taming, truffle rate, young growing up, new foods)"}	blake3:-LP2z-hYg6TR1xIVfXIh1HGQpBVQt1GpJIgp7dpFIYU
1792468436905035	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-2l6b	{"description":"Untested with two players: a goose owned by another client chasing a stranger (UpdateAI runs on the owner), petting adding a remote player to byre_known (RPC Byre_Know), plucking/milking another owner's animal, a pig following one player while another owns it rooting truffles, tame boars' pig litters on a dedicated server.","kind":"task","labels":["byre","needs-multiplayer"],"size":"s","title":"Byre 0.3.0: multiplayer check of goose guard, plucking, truffles and boar litters on another player's animals"}	blake3:U8otFo-r1VoZkTZiN-5S58fCOqm4w93D2A64JEIl_hU
