1792468464805910	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-259w	{"body":"Done in Byre 0.3.0 (c008767). ByreCow/ByreCalf/ByreCow_ragdoll on the boar made 1.9x, own Blender model (horns, udder, red with white). Wild herds in the Meadows (CowChance 15), tamed with food, Procreation pairs -> calves. Milked with ByreMilkPail -> ByreCowMilk (2-3/day fed). Drops RawMeat 3-5, DeerHide 2-3, LeatherScraps 2-3. Commandable (follows). Api 3: CanPull true for a tame grown cow. Live: tame cow milked (2 jugs, 24 h wait), byre breed gave a calf, model looked right in the hall. Unit tests 98 pass."}	blake3:WpoyzcD_cdADiaGMOFLMNZXoUIXtnSlyBSIznKDgS_Y
1792468464834366	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1308	{"body":"Done in Byre 0.3.0 (c008767). ByreGoose/ByreGosling on the game's Hen (MaterialVariation stripped), own greylag model; ByreGooseEgg (ChickenEgg 1.35x, EggGrow -> tame gosling under roof by fire; cauldron: 2 CookedEgg). Feathers: plucked by hand every 2 days (2-3 fed) plus 2-4 on death. Guard: tame grown goose chases nearest stranger within 8 m (unpetted player or untamed non-Players creature), stops 1.6 m short, gives up after 5 s / 12 m, rests 10 s, no damage; petting/plucking -> byre_known. Live: eggs laid (pair and lone), one hatched indoors by the fire, the outdoor one didn't grow; plucked 1 feather (hungry); a goose chased Bob outdoors 6 m -> 1.2 m and stopped; after plucking it knew him (no chase)."}	blake3:Dpn-qgGEvkgvoQqxtF2RXEn0FPdzLSHotx5yg8PkwA4
1792468464852937	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-vc0i	{"body":"Done in Byre 0.3.0 (c008767). Breeding.cs: prefix on Procreation.Procreate swaps a tame Boar's due offspring for ByrePiglet at PigFromBoarChance (25%); ByrePig breeds true, never wild, commandable. Truffles: tame grown pig following someone in the Black Forest, checked once a minute on the owner, 1-in-TruffleMinutes (10) roll, 3 min gap -> ByreTruffle (baked model, food). Live: 2 tame boars via byre breed: 3 ByrePiglet in 9 births; a tame pig told to follow (E) in the Black Forest: natural roll empty, forced root dropped a truffle."}	blake3:sMFmlmblK1D52VZya9UL2uuvXXxPIeA2Qo-W6-PRxFg
1792468464872423	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2mpi	{"body":"Released as 0.3.0 (0.2.0 was taken by S3): c008767 pushed, dist/Byre.dll + manifest updated, CHANGELOG/DESCRIPTION/README. Unit tests 98 pass. Menu reload (ClaudeTools reload Byre, the mod's level) clean x5: Made 24 prefabs, no errors. Live in Creative: cow milked, geese laid/hatched/chased, pigs bred from boars, truffle in the Black Forest. Test animals/items cleared; Bob's bag same but +4 Feathers from auto-pickup while plucking. Over-time and MP checks filed as needs-player / needs-multiplayer bones."}	blake3:MaCCpFwaG9atrVg48WYeCNnOefYz88UJXusu_Y7qsEU
1792468464890708	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-24c	{"body":"All milestones shipped: S1 (0.1.x), S3 barn set + Api 2 (0.2.0), S2 cattle/geese/pigs + Api 3 (0.3.0, c008767). Useful alone (wild herds, taming, harvests, troughs, racks, stalls, eggs, truffles); Jarldom integration via Byre.Api (herders shear/milk via Harvest, Byre room). Remaining play-only checks are in separate needs-player/needs-multiplayer bones."}	blake3:zAuUMV6wn-pjiU_zbARPe4bEfKi7Yjm-I85GOjsH3Rc
