1792472154389169	claude	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-ly9l	{"body":"Fixed in Wayfinder 0.1.15 (c062df8). Ships carry a mark (bob_wayfinder_mark); Find falls back to a sector search by mark, or for old entries the nearest ship within 6 m. Unnamed fleet ships get the fleet name written onto them (the id-derived name changed each session). Also: static fleet state survived logout, so a plain relog read the old pins as removed by hand and forgot the whole fleet. Now keyed by Player instance. Live: test karve Tide-Hart kept its entry, mark, name and pin over 2 plain relogs."}	blake3:tF8Devscg-wDQPpLs_wqUzyu1SUhawcYp4W8dzjWRaE
