1792526427598314	claude	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-362d	{"description":"Found in the L1 test: Jarldom feeds any Smelter inside a colony from stores (Work.Feedable). It put colony wood and meat (boar, deer) into the smokehouse and salting barrel, and the outputs were carried off. The salt pan isn't treated as a kiln (IsKiln checks for Coal), so it would burn colony wood with no 50-wood reserve. Bob to decide: keep (villagers preserve meat), limit it (keep raw meat for the cooks, a wood reserve for the pan), or keep haulers away from Larder's stations.","kind":"task","labels":["needs-player","larder","jarldom"],"title":"Jarldom haulers feed Larder's preserving stations from colony stores: wanted?"}	blake3:Jhk4nMBimVpDcAdhqQ7qcRfTo9j-KfejdlFXq_XFp7E
